title: "QubitMan: environment-assisted quantum walks for allosteric site finding"
abstract: >-
  A dephased continuous-time quantum walk on residue contact networks, with a
  distance-adjusted allosteric test, a classical random-walk baseline, a
  random-energy null model and permutation p-values; plus a local web app.
authors:
